    "message": "Hash a world's canonical JSON without parsing it back\n\ndigest(world.to_dict()) encoded the world to canonical JSON, parsed it back\ninto a dict, and encoded that again to hash it. Re-encoding parsed\ncanonical JSON gives the same text, so WorldState.state_digest() hashes\ncanonical_json() directly. Frames of minutes between saved Checkpoints,\nintervention previews and applies, PDF reports and validation results use\nit; a 1440-minute frame between Checkpoints went from 5.9 s to 4.9 s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
